{"title":"짝사랑이 페로몬을 숨기면 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"“좋아하면 안 돼.”\n\n예찬은 오랫동안 서재오를 짝사랑해 왔다. \n하지만 서재오는 자신의 누나 때문에 잘해 주는 것이다. \n가능성 따위는 없으니 예찬은 착각하지 않으려 했다.\n\n페로몬을 억제하고, 거리를 두고, 이대로 끝내려 했다. \n그렇게 하면, 감정도 서서히 사라질 줄 알았다. \n그런데—","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":162,"change":{"type":"up","amount":100}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":179,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":289,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":247,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":247,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":247,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":247,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":248,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":248,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":248,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":248,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":248,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":248,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":248,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":248,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":248,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":248,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-25","v":248,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-26","v":248,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-27","v":259,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-28","v":259,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-29","v":259,"rc":0,"rs":0,"cc":0}]}